<title>HONG KONG: Krung Thai Bank launches $100 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Krung Thai Bank launches $100 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger BZW Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER    KRUNG THAI BANK PLC, SINGAPORE BRANCH</p>
<p> AMOUNT	US$100 MLN  COUPON     6ML+35BP  MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	  FRCD	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 LAUNCH   03.JUN.97</p>
<p> PUTS	  NONE	  CALLS	NONE	REPLIES  16.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING     NONE	  REPAYMENT  BULLET    DENOMS   $500K</p>
<p> RATING	A3/A **     SALE LMTS  STANDARD  TAX PROV --</p>
<p> NEG PLG     YES	   CRS DEF    YES	 FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY   THAILAND    GOV LAW    ENGLISH   PAY DATE  END JUNE</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   LEAD MANAGERS     US$7 MLN+    35   BP   ALL-IN  42</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS  US$5 MLN     27.5 BP   ALL-IN  40.5</p>
<p>   CO-MANAGERS	 US$3 MLN     20   BP   ALL-IN  39</p>
<p> ARRANGERS AND JOINT BOOKRUNNERS</p>
<p> ASAHI FINANCE (HONG KONG), BANKGESELLSCHAFT BERLIN AG, BZW</p>
<p> ASIA AND NOMURA INTERNATIONAL (HONG KONG)</p>
<p> NOTES   **ISSUER RATING</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
